          "quote": "BS0 (pin 10) → GND; BS1 (pin 11) → VCC; BS2 (pin 12) → GND"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "That BS2,BS1,BS0 = 0,1,0 strapping ... is the SSD1306's documented I2C-mode pin configuration"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The OLED's interface mode will not match the MCU's two-wire wiring, so the display is unlikely to communicate correctly over the intended I2C connection.",
